  "description": "Source-generated endpoint organization for ASP.NET Core Minimal APIs. Implement\n      IEndpoint with a static Map method, group endpoints with IEndpointGroup and EndpointGroup\n      attributes, and map every endpoint of an assembly with one generated, reflection-free call.\n      Route calls stay in user code, so binding, filters, OpenAPI and the Request Delegate\n      Generator work unchanged. Trim and AOT friendly.",
